Treatment is binary, so you could treat it as numeric (with codes 1 and
0). For 'species', I would suggest to (manually) construct 2 dummy
variables, using 1/0 coding. The numeric 'treatment' variable and the
two dummy variables can be used as exogenous (fixed) covariates, just
like you would in any ordinary regression model.

Yves.

